data: {"id": "1230c6965e574a4d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1293", "run_id": "1230c6965e574a4d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我根据已有的真实工具结果，对该 Pod 的异常状态进行初步分析。\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4`\n- **UID**: `6d7ef0ba-939d-4371-a7d9-b332d976d782` (来自 Topology 查询)\n- **当前状态**: `Pending` / `ImagePullBackOff`\n- **所属控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794`\n- **调度节点**: `node2`\n\n**事实**：Pod 处于 **未恢复的异常状态**，生命周期从创建开始就一直卡在镜像拉取阶段，尚未进入 `Running` 或 `Failed` 阶段。\n\n---\n\n### 2. 支持\"ImagePullFailed\"的事实\n以下所有证据都一致地指向**镜像拉取失败**，且根因是**镜像地址不可达或无效**：\n\n1. **Pod 状态证据**：\n   - `STATUS: ImagePullBackOff`，`READY: 0/1`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788411471839, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

